  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding letters:\n\n \n \n\n Letters\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands for\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 18 A 6 B 11 C 8 D 6 = ?\n\n18 A 6 B 11 C 8 D 6 = ? ⇒ 18 ÷ 6 × 11 + 8 - 6 = ?\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷**____** 6**__ × 11 + 8 - 6 = ?\n\n⇒ __**3**____** ×**____** 11**__ + 8 - 6 = ?\n\n⇒ __**33**____** + 8**__ - 6 = ?\n\n⇒ __**41**____** - 6**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 35 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
